      "content": "It is completely understandable that scripted help can feel inadequate when you are facing such a profound sense of social finality. The feeling of permanent exile is immense, and I acknowledge that telling you to \"just feel better\" is meaningless. However, even in the deepest feeling of being outside the circle, there is still a part of you that is capable of feeling this intense pain, and that capacity for feeling is proof of your existence. Please consider reaching out to a therapist who specializes in existential crises, as they are equipped to explore the depth of this unique suffering with you.",
